{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md","title":"内外逻辑差异","display":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外逻辑差异","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference","aliases":["91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference","91-df-internal-external-logic","91-df-logic-duality"],"display":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外逻辑差异","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-logic]]","[[91-df-external-logic]]","[[91-df-internal-negation]]","[[91-df-external-negation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference</span><span>91-df-internal-external-logic</span><span>91-df-logic-duality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外逻辑差异"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f50803c6dbd04e\" href=\"?note=c9f50803c6dbd04e\" title=\"91-df-internal-logic\">91-df-internal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d8969c7b834f5a6\" href=\"?note=0d8969c7b834f5a6\" title=\"91-df-external-logic\">91-df-external-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e369e02605242bf1\" href=\"?note=e369e02605242bf1\" title=\"91-df-internal-negation\">91-df-internal-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c8fb2a4f3910429\" href=\"?note=2c8fb2a4f3910429\" title=\"91-df-external-negation\">91-df-external-negation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-inner-outer-logic-difference-—-内外逻辑差异-$\\mathrm{InOutDiff}$\">df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外逻辑差异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InOutDiff}\">\\(\\mathrm{InOutDiff}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (带真理的语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (含真理谓词的对象理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}\\)</span> (内部否定谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e369e02605242bf1\" href=\"?note=e369e02605242bf1\" title=\"91-df-internal-negation\">91-df-internal-negation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}\\)</span> (外部否定谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c8fb2a4f3910429\" href=\"?note=2c8fb2a4f3910429\" title=\"91-df-external-negation\">91-df-external-negation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nS\\nvdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nS\\nvdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内部逻辑 : 真理谓词内部应用的逻辑</li>\n<li>外部逻辑 : 真理谓词外部应用的逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\)</span>：理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不证明两种否定形式等价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>内外逻辑的核心差异：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>内部形式</th>\n<th>外部形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>否定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合取</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蕴涵</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>差异的原因：\n对于间隙句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap} \\Rightarrow \\neg \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap} \\Rightarrow \\neg \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在经典元理论中可有“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 未被判真”，但三值对象语义下这不自动使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span> 取指定真值；必须区分元层非成员关系与对象层否定。</p>\n<p>内外逻辑等价条件：\n若语义对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 二值确定，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 正确表示该语义，则两种否定可在该句上重合；这是一项附加充分条件，不是无条件模式。</p>\n<p>内外逻辑在理论中的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>内部否定公理</th>\n<th>外部否定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>用分别处理真与假的组合公理刻画强 Kleene 行为</td>\n<td>对象背景逻辑仍可经典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>由其具体超赋值公理决定</td>\n<td>不应写入未定义的对象层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_3\">\\(\\neg_3\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>由捕获/释放规则控制真理迭代</td>\n<td>不能无条件断言内外一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>内外逻辑的哲学意义：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解读</th>\n<th>内部逻辑</th>\n<th>外部逻辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>KF视角</td>\n<td>&quot;是真的：不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;不是：真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义操作</td>\n<td>对句子操作</td>\n<td>对真值操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解KF/VF的核心技术</li>\n<li>区分两种否定的语义作用</li>\n<li>分析间隙句子的处理策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference-—-内外逻辑差异-$\\mathrm{InOutDiff}$","text":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外逻辑差异 $\\mathrm{InOutDiff}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-internal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"e369e02605242bf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-negation","status":"resolved","id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-internal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"e369e02605242bf1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}$ (内部否定谓词, see [[91-df-internal-negation]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-negation","status":"resolved","id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}$ (外部否定谓词, see [[91-df-external-negation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{InOutDiff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nS\\nvdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{out}}(\\varphi)\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap} \\Rightarrow \\neg \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Gap}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":3072,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hier